## Key Concepts
- IncrementalPCA for streaming data
- Imputation and scaling in a tight loop
- Explained_variance_ratio for component budgeting
- Drift detection and retraining triggers under latency constraints

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: update loop for streaming features
let pca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents: k});
for (chunk of stream) {
  let X = imputeAndScale(chunk); //  // mean impute + scale
  pca.partialFit(X);
  let Z = pca.transform(X);
  detector.predict(Z);
  monitorDrift(pca.explainedVarianceRatio_, pca.components_);
}
```

